      "parity_sources": [],
      "family_page": "07_Case_Reference",
      "entry_anchor_prefix": "p07_cap_les_",
      "coverage_enforced": true,
      "coverage_note": "Coverage is enforced. Both models were previously known-defective - the dynamic procedure built both terms of the Germano tensor from separately test-filtered quantities, so it had no dynamic content, and the constant model never produced an eddy viscosity on a fresh run. Both defects are fixed and carry mutation-tested unit coverage plus an end-to-end trend check. They are experimental rather than supported because no reference-flow comparison has been run: the decaying isotropic turbulence benchmark that would settle Cs near 0.16-0.17 has not been carried to a developed state.",
